      "section": "496",
      "source": "CrPC",
      "quote": "When any person other than a person accused of a non-bailable offence ... is prepared ... to give bail, such person shall be released on bail: Provided that such officer or Court, if he or it thinks fit, may, instead of taking bail from such person, discharge him on his executing a bond without sureties"
    },
